OL,3,GNEWSADevelopment of 400 homes could
OL,4,A'save dying town'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA controversial 400-home development is
OL,7,Fthe best way to save Leatherhead from
OL,8,F"dying", a councillor has said.
OL,10,FThe comments came during a debate at
OL,11,FMole Valley District Council over the
OL,12,Fproposed Bull Hill regeneration scheme,
OL,13,Fwhich has faced opposition from some
OL,14,Fresidents.
OL,16,FIndependent councillor Gerry Sevenoaks
OL,17,Fraised concerns about traffic and
OL,18,Flengthy building works and said some of
OL,19,Fthe financial and community benefits
OL,20,Foriginally put forward had been
OL,21,Freduced.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
