OL,3,GNEWSADevelopment of 400 homes could
OL,4,A'save dying town'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors defending the scheme said
OL,7,Fthere was a strong silent majority in
OL,8,Ffavour of the scheme and it was not
OL,9,Fraised as a major issue by residents
OL,10,Fduring the local elections, according
OL,11,Fto the Local Democracy Reporting
OL,12,FService.
